    "name": "Starshapes",
    "steam_appid": 2386910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starshapes is a sleek puzzle drawing game where your solutions become beautiful neon-like star constellations. Many puzzles have multiple logic-based solutions, allowing for freedom to experiment with the game mechanics and finding unconventional solutions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzle constellations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go stargazing and re-imagine the night sky by drawing your own constellations in 3D puzzles with multiple solutions. Experience constellations from new angles in three dimensions as you etch them into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your own path through puzzles and unlock new and interesting rules as you progress. Unwind with \u2018Connect the dots\u2019 style secret levels featuring real-life constellations and star signs. Soak in the beautiful starlight of all the puzzles you\u2019ve completed along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create new constellations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.poster.avif?t=1752954282\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.webm?t=1752954282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.mp4?t=1752954282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Draw, Erase and Edit connections between stars to solve the puzzle and create a constellation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag and rotate puzzles in 3D to view them from different angles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Smooth and elegant animations make learning the gameplay easy and intuitive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stargaze your own way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tailor your experience with accessibility features, such as color-blindness options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Undo, Redo and Reset with convenient shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Observe abstract space</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Zoom out and view the constellations you have made so far and track your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play puzzles of varying difficulty, ranging from simple connect the dots puzzles to more challenging ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Starshapes features over 50 hand-made puzzles and all 88 IAU recognized real-life constellations as bonus puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starshapes is a sleek puzzle drawing game where your solutions become beautiful neon-like star constellations. Many puzzles have multiple logic-based solutions, allowing for freedom to experiment with the game mechanics and finding unconventional solutions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve puzzle constellations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go stargazing and re-imagine the night sky by drawing your own constellations in 3D puzzles with multiple solutions. Experience constellations from new angles in three dimensions as you etch them into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your own path through puzzles and unlock new and interesting rules as you progress. Unwind with \u2018Connect the dots\u2019 style secret levels featuring real-life constellations and star signs. Soak in the beautiful starlight of all the puzzles you\u2019ve completed along your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create new constellations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.poster.avif?t=1752954282\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.webm?t=1752954282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2386910/extras/d8ee3b21ac544b3f036c3160de36bf91.mp4?t=1752954282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Draw, Erase and Edit connections between stars to solve the puzzle and create a constellation. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag and rotate puzzles in 3D to view them from different angles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Smooth and elegant animations make learning the gameplay easy and intuitive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stargaze your own way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tailor your experience with accessibility features, such as color-blindness options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Undo, Redo and Reset with convenient shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Observe abstract space</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Zoom out and view the constellations you have made so far and track your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play puzzles of varying difficulty, ranging from simple connect the dots puzzles to more challenging ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Starshapes features over 50 hand-made puzzles and all 88 IAU recognized real-life constellations as bonus puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Draw beautiful 3D star constellations to solve puzzles in space. Connect abstract shapes to form neon-lit stars and uncover both real and fictional constellations.",
